{"data": {"id": "df9034b99d2b42935172e9d94a7f506d0643d6e0f4f57566b45259a6ad154923", "lineage": "df9034b99d2b42935172e9d94a7f506d0643d6e0f4f57566b45259a6ad154923", "origin": "sample:1", "parent": null, "source": "import java.util.*;\n\npublic final class Solution {\n    public static Object solve(Map<String, Object> data) {\n        String text = (String) data.get(\"text\");\n        StringBuilder filtered = new StringBuilder();\n        for (char c : text.toCharArray()) {\n            if (Character.isLetterOrDigit(c)) {\n                filtered.append(Character.toLowerCase(c));\n            }\n        }\n        String s = filtered.toString();\n        int n = s.length();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n / 2; i++) {\n            if (s.charAt(i) != s.charAt(n - 1 - i)) {\n                return false;\n            }\n        }\n        return true;\n    }\n}"}, "kind": "candidate", "prev": "8487110c0aa6d014c5725cd92c7ed81d67c891c452d7648b83d126dd83424f22", "seq": 6}
